Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Either you translate it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.66,0:00:03.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}you explain it to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}what is in the knowledge of\NAllah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:11.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}or knowledge about Allah's\Nessence himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:14.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}That our knowledge cannot\Nencompass it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}about Allah's essence,\Neverything about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:17.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.42,0:00:20.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Or about the things inside\Nhis knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.78,0:00:23.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}subhanahu wa ta'ala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.40,0:00:25.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Our own knowledge cannot\Nencompass everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.20,0:00:28.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}What that means is that he is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:30.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}ever absolutely more\Nknowledgeable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.04,0:00:31.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}than all of us in every\Ncircumstance,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:33.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}subhanahu wa ta'ala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:38.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}So, Allah is alamu in every\Ncircumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}This is wa anna allaha qad\Nahata
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.57,0:00:43.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}bi kulli shay'in ilmah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:47.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Allah subhanahu wa ta'ala,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:49.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}his knowledge encompasses\Neverything,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}ahata bi kulli shay'in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:54.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}As for Banu Adam,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:56.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}our own knowledge is small.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:58.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Very small knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:01.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}When he spoke about our\Nknowledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:02.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}he says,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.70,0:01:04.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}wa ma hu ti tum min al
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.89,0:01:07.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}ilmillah qalila.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:09.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}So, we've not given you from\Nknowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.53,0:01:11.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}except a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:14.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}So, Allah is alamu in every\Ncircumstance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:16.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}and in every situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:19.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}So, if you are not saying\Nanything,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.86,0:01:21.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}and you say Allahu alamu,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.43,0:01:23.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}yes, what you said is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.06,0:01:26.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}If you explain and yet you\Ncome
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.13,0:01:28.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}back and say Allahu alamu,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}it's also true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.76,0:01:32.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}So, in any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.16,0:01:33.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}Allahu is alamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}But, make sure that you are\Nnot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:36.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}employing that situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.14,0:01:40.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}that expression to imply any\Nsort of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:43.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}a deceit or the likes of\Nthat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:45.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}No, don't deceive the people\Nusing these
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.42,0:01:47.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1296)}kinds of expressions.

